iv><div class="widget-panel p-3 text-left  flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[var(--bg-inset)]" style="color:#3B82F6"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v18M7 21h10M3 7h2c2 0 5-1 7-2 2 1 5 2 7 2h2M16 16l3-8 3 8c-.87.65-1.92 1-3 1s-2.13-.35-3-1zM2 16l3-8 3 8c-.87.65-1.92 1-3 1s-2.13-.35-3-1z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-base font-bold leading-tight text-[var(--fg)]">Amount Restrictions</span></div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-[#1c9c62]/12 text-[#1c9c62]">On</span></div><div class="text-sm text-[var(--fg-muted)]"><div>Per sender: 5</div></div></div><div class="widget-panel p-3 text-left opacity-55 flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[var(--bg-inset)]" style="color:#EC4899"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 9h16M4 15h16M10 3 8 21M16 3l-2 18"></path></svg></span><span class="text-base font-bold leading-tight text-[var(--fg)]">Max Transfers</span></div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-[var(--bg-inset)] text-[var(--fg-muted)]">Off</span></div><div class="text-sm text-[var(--fg-muted)]">Unlimited uses</div></div><div class="widget-panel p-3 text-left opacity-55 flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md b